    "name": "SCP: Control Error",
    "steam_appid": 3642560,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642560/extras/42a7dc3d1fce88f4100b5f118e391a21.avif?t=1748617542\" width=800 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCP: CONTROL ERROR is a short, first-person psychological horror game set in 1985</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Barry Gittings - a man who volunteered for a classified experiment inside the Vortex Complex, a remote underground facility established during the Cold War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t know what\u2019s behind the next door.<br>You don\u2019t know who\u2019s watching.<br>You only know the doors opened, the voice welcomed you, and the test began.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sealed research chambers. Solve strange cognitive trials. Read internal reports and documents left behind by those who came before - or maybe didn\u2019t leave at all.<br>No jump scares. No gunfights. Just you, the test, and something you can\u2019t quite see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a branching narrative. It\u2019s a <strong>live experiment</strong>. And it keeps evolving based on what players choose - beyond the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players decide. Not developers.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, tightly focused first-person horror experience (30\u201345 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a Cold War-era research facility with a dark secret</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve immersive environmental puzzles and cognitive trials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not told what\u2019s happening - only shown what was recorded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A community-influenced narrative - shaped by real player choices, just like how the SCP Foundation grows through every member\u2019s contribution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Game was created by Chieftain Artworks - a mysterious solo developer who remains in hiding. Only one thing we know - he is a part of the SCP community.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642560/extras/42a7dc3d1fce88f4100b5f118e391a21.avif?t=1748617542\" width=800 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCP: CONTROL ERROR is a short, first-person psychological horror game set in 1985</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Barry Gittings - a man who volunteered for a classified experiment inside the Vortex Complex, a remote underground facility established during the Cold War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t know what\u2019s behind the next door.<br>You don\u2019t know who\u2019s watching.<br>You only know the doors opened, the voice welcomed you, and the test began.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sealed research chambers. Solve strange cognitive trials. Read internal reports and documents left behind by those who came before - or maybe didn\u2019t leave at all.<br>No jump scares. No gunfights. Just you, the test, and something you can\u2019t quite see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a branching narrative. It\u2019s a <strong>live experiment</strong>. And it keeps evolving based on what players choose - beyond the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players decide. Not developers.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, tightly focused first-person horror experience (30\u201345 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a Cold War-era research facility with a dark secret</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve immersive environmental puzzles and cognitive trials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not told what\u2019s happening - only shown what was recorded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A community-influenced narrative - shaped by real player choices, just like how the SCP Foundation grows through every member\u2019s contribution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Game was created by Chieftain Artworks - a mysterious solo developer who remains in hiding. Only one thing we know - he is a part of the SCP community.</i></p>",
